ts)<br /> <br /> <b>--- Vase Demon ---</b><br /> The vase demon alternates between being called Reme<u><b>n</b></u>tic and Remeti<u><b>n</b></u>c across its entry, it's not clear which one is the correct name<br /> <br /> <b>--- Snake Mount ---</b><br /> The snake mount is called a desertier. Is this intended to be a made up word, or is it a typo for destrier?<br /> double 9s on the attack <u>role</u> (roll)<br /> the <u>greet</u> living mask of a lion appears (green? great?)<br /> The leontoidser is sometimes called leon<b><u>s</u></b>toidser instead<br /> <br /> <b>--- Spider Pirate ---</b><br /> The Eight-Fold <u>Captains</u> many limbs (Captain's)<br /> her <u>crews</u> belief in her (crew's)<br /> two bonus <u>die</u> (dice)<br /> In <u>comabt</u> (combat)<br /> <br /> <b>--- Rebel Saint ---</b><br /> Iron Fortress Island in Kimbery, where gathering demons with arms and armor. (incomplete sentence? can't really make sense of it. 1st sentence in the entry.)<br /> Those that fear <u>might</u> gods (mighty?)<br /> it has lost <u>it\u2019s</u> vitality (its)<br /> the <u>opponents</u> blow (opponent's or opponents')<br /> Megidez is sometimes called Megediz<br /> his <u>firey</u> vision (fiery)<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25285-epitome","name":"Epitome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25285_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"754"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-11-03T09:59:22-08:00","id":1345601,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Epitome</strong> <a href